<div class="sedna-col sedna-gap-12" style="max-width:520px">
    <div class="card">
        <div class="empty-state">
            <svg class="state-art" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#nothing-yet" /></svg>
            <span class="empty-state-title">Create your first order</span>
            <p>Orders appear here as they are placed, by you or by the shop.</p>
            <button class="btn btn--sm btn--brand btn--solid" type="button"><i class="ri-add-line"></i> <span>Create an order</span></button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="empty-state">
            <svg class="state-art" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#no-results" /></svg>
            <span class="empty-state-title">Check the spelling of &ldquo;eu-wets&rdquo;</span>
            <p>Nothing matches it. Clear the search to see all 1,204 orders.</p>
            <button class="btn btn--sm" type="button"><i class="ri-close-circle-line"></i> <span>Clear search</span></button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="empty-state">
            <svg class="state-art" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#filtered-out" /></svg>
            <span class="empty-state-title">Remove a filter to see orders</span>
            <p>Nothing matches the 3 filters applied. Removing the date range would show 84 orders.</p>
            <button class="btn btn--sm" type="button"><i class="ri-filter-off-line"></i> <span>Clear filters</span></button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="empty-state">
            <svg class="state-art" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#no-access" /></svg>
            <span class="empty-state-title">Ask an administrator for access</span>
            <p>Regional figures are limited to account leads. The role that opens this region is
            <code>orders.read</code>.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="empty-state">
            <svg class="state-art" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#all-done" /></svg>
            <span class="empty-state-title">The queue is clear</span>
            <p>Every order in the queue has been decided. The next one will arrive here.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
